	measure 'Early Payment Spend (>3 Days)' = ```
			
			CALCULATE(
			    SUM('sam_coupa_invoices_lines'[$ Spend]),
			    'sam_coupa_invoices_lines'[header_paid] = "true",
			    DATEDIFF('sam_coupa_invoices_lines'[payment_date_line], 'sam_coupa_invoices_lines'[header_due_date], DAY) <= -3
			)
			
			```
